Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on 0610.

The authored async_loading bytecode's FELoadingToGame and GameLoadingToFE
entries (static call graph, both scripts) reach 123 DoFunctionCall services.
Move the 99 of them that were behind the generic frontend-sequence gate
under the named MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_MATCH_LOADING admission,
splitting gated blocks only at case boundaries (fall-through partners stay
together). Case bodies are unchanged; every service not reached by those two
scripts keeps its existing gate.

InitializeFEState2's re-entry branch (any frontend entry after the first) is
admitted under the same name instead of the sequence diagnostic's stop. The
original then selects the landing scene by mode: Main Menu or Choose Captains
for exhibition, the Striker Cup hub (round news, goal trophies, save), the
challenge listing, or the online/tournament scenes.

